00:33:38.640 --> 00:33:41.040
as social morals or right and wrong.

831
00:33:41.040 --> 00:33:45.300
So if I said that you were a really kind person,

832
00:33:45.300 --> 00:33:46.320
or I said that you were a liar,

833
00:33:46.320 --> 00:33:48.270
those are moral emotional sentiments.

834
00:33:48.270 --> 00:33:49.680
Another way to think of it is just outrage.

835
00:33:49.680 --> 00:33:52.230
Outrage is the most powerful moral emotional sentiment.

836
00:33:52.230 --> 00:33:55.110
And outrage is different from anger because it means,

837
00:33:55.110 --> 00:33:56.640
I think that you have transgressed

838
00:33:56.640 --> 00:33:57.927
a wrong against the community,

839
00:33:57.927 --> 00:33:59.850
and I think that you've transgressed a wrong

840
00:33:59.850 --> 00:34:02.010
against the social norms that hold us together.

