845
00:34:14.340 --> 00:34:17.760
that were going to increase engagement.

846
00:34:17.760 --> 00:34:20.250
And they basically, every kind of sentiment

847
00:34:20.250 --> 00:34:22.530
was much closer to neutral that they thought.

848
00:34:22.530 --> 00:34:24.510
Angry words didn't seem to have much of an effect,

849
00:34:24.510 --> 00:34:27.900
left leaning or right leaning words, sad words, happy words,

