00:34:27.900 --> 00:34:29.190
even words like "car wreck",

851
00:34:29.190 --> 00:34:31.230
like exciting words didn't have much of a difference.

852
00:34:31.230 --> 00:34:36.230
But every moral, emotional word had a 20% increase

853
00:34:37.470 --> 00:34:40.950
in the reach of any tweet that contained it, which is huge.

854
00:34:40.950 --> 00:34:41.783
That's nuts.

855
00:34:41.783 --> 00:34:44.010
Although if you have spent time on Twitter,

856
00:34:44.010 --> 00:34:46.345
that's something that you very quickly learn

857
00:34:46.345 --> 00:34:48.300
is that that is the kind of sentiment that travels.

858
00:34:48.300 --> 00:34:53.300
But the piece of this experiment that really stuck with me,

859
00:34:53.370 --> 00:34:55.923
