00:34:56.880 --> 00:35:00.060
is that they would take these research subjects,

861
00:35:00.060 --> 00:35:01.590
and they would try to poll them

862
00:35:01.590 --> 00:35:04.140
and basically gauge their sense of internal outrage.

863
00:35:04.140 --> 00:35:07.560
As a person, how prone to outrage were they

864
00:35:07.560 --> 00:35:10.320
at people who they thought of as their out group?

