00:35:10.320 --> 00:35:11.490
You know, if they're a Liberal,

866
00:35:11.490 --> 00:35:14.730
people they thought of Conservatives, vice versa,

867
00:35:14.730 --> 00:35:17.730
you know, can be a division by race, by religion.

868
00:35:17.730 --> 00:35:20.520
And people who had a very low propensity to outrage

869
00:35:20.520 --> 00:35:23.610
if the researchers nudge them to say, you know,

