00:35:31.710 --> 00:35:33.120
because that's what the platform does.

874
00:35:33.120 --> 00:35:34.530
It identifies those as engaging,

875
00:35:34.530 --> 00:35:35.820
and pushes them out to a lot of people

876
00:35:35.820 --> 00:35:37.140
and gives you a social reward

877
00:35:37.140 --> 00:35:40.320
in terms of lots of likes and retweets,

878
00:35:40.320 --> 00:35:43.140
is that the subject would internalize that,

879
00:35:43.140 --> 00:35:45.900
and first start to send more tweets like that

880
00:35:45.900 --> 00:35:47.730
just to chase the high.

881
00:35:47.730 --> 00:35:48.840
But then soon enough,

882
00:35:48.840 --> 00:35:51.540
that urge would start to come from within,

883
00:35:51.540 --> 00:35:54.030
the research subject would send outrage tweets

884
00:35:54.030 --> 00:35:56.220
even if they didn't get a reward,

885
00:35:56.220 --> 00:35:59.460
because their nature had fundamentally been changed in the,

886
00:35:59.460 --> 00:36:03.180
what they found in the kind of polls and studies

887
00:36:03.180 --> 00:36:05.490
they would take with these individual people is their,

888
00:36:05.490 --> 00:36:07.620
the outrage they felt internally

889
00:36:07.620 --> 00:36:09.690
even when they were offline had increased.

890
00:36:09.690 --> 00:36:12.330
So this training effect of the platforms

891
00:36:12.330 --> 00:36:15.750
in terms of what works is so powerful,

892
00:36:15.750 --> 00:36:17.190
that just spending time on it,

893
00:36:17.190 --> 00:36:20.220
you inevitably end up not just serving the platform

