00:36:20.220 --> 00:36:22.980
when you're online, but in your offline life,

895
00:36:22.980 --> 00:36:25.770
your emotional balance changes.

896
00:36:25.770 --> 00:36:27.480
It's really terrifying,

897
00:36:27.480 --> 00:36:28.890
you know, when you think about that.

898
00:36:28.890 --> 00:36:30.180
Yeah.

899
00:36:30.180 --> 00:36:33.300
The fact that something performative

900
00:36:33.300 --> 00:36:35.490
could become so internalized,

901
00:36:35.490 --> 00:36:38.520
that it changes your sensibility and your identity,

