2352
01:35:31.320 --> 01:35:35.040
So this is the Justine Sacco example of,

2353
01:35:35.040 --> 01:35:36.600
so you've been publicly shamed.

2354
01:35:36.600 --> 01:35:39.960
Like the people who misstep,

2355
01:35:39.960 --> 01:35:43.740
sometimes with intent, sometimes without intent,

2356
01:35:43.740 --> 01:35:48.090
who then suffer a disproportionate amount of,

2357
01:35:48.090 --> 01:35:52.800
you know, alienation and out group dissonance,

2358
01:35:52.800 --> 01:35:55.920
you know, or even outward hate as a result.

2359
01:35:55.920 --> 01:35:59.220
And this is something that is created by a social dynamic.

2360
01:35:59.220 --> 01:36:02.640
It's not driven by the guideposts

2361
01:36:02.640 --> 01:36:05.730
of the platforms themselves,

2362
01:36:05.730 --> 01:36:07.350
but ultimately is having

2363
01:36:07.350 --> 01:36:10.230
a real pernicious effect culturally,

2364
01:36:10.230 --> 01:36:12.090
and I think a chilling effect on, you know,

2365
01:36:12.090 --> 01:36:15.600
people feeling like they should even say anything,

2366
01:36:15.600 --> 01:36:17.340
like what is, why should I?

