01:36:19.980 --> 01:36:21.210
who wants to go through that?

2369
01:36:21.210 --> 01:36:22.650
Like, I mean, nobody does.

2370
01:36:22.650 --> 01:36:23.483
It's terrible.

2371
01:36:23.483 --> 01:36:28.260
And that deep sense of being cast out of the tribe

2372
01:36:28.260 --> 01:36:30.540
is a very primal, painful thing

2373
01:36:30.540 --> 01:36:31.590
that you talk about in the book.

2374
01:36:31.590 --> 01:36:32.580
Like physically painful.

2375
01:36:32.580 --> 01:36:35.370
You experience it as physical pain.

2376
01:36:35.370 --> 01:36:38.790
Right, because we evolved in an environment

2377
01:36:38.790 --> 01:36:41.490
where you literally cannot survive

2378
01:36:41.490 --> 01:36:44.520
without the approval and support of your community.

2379
01:36:44.520 --> 01:36:47.040
It's, you know, tribes of like 100, 150 people

2380
01:36:47.040 --> 01:36:50.460
that we evolved in where this was something that was,

2381
01:36:50.460 --> 01:36:51.720
