2382
01:36:51.720 --> 01:36:55.800
And if you lost it, if you upset the rest of your tribe,

2383
01:36:55.800 --> 01:36:57.210
it could often be fatal.

2384
01:36:57.210 --> 01:36:59.310
So that is why when we,

2385
01:36:59.310 --> 01:37:02.220
