2386
01:37:02.220 --> 01:37:03.930
it feels really, really bad

2387
01:37:03.930 --> 01:37:08.010
because your brain has evolved to experiencing that

2388
01:37:08.010 --> 01:37:11.610
as a mortal threat, akin to, you know,

2389
01:37:11.610 --> 01:37:14.850
being stabbed with a spear, akin to losing access to food.

2390
01:37:14.850 --> 01:37:18.421
But because of the way that social media works,

2391
01:37:18.421 --> 01:37:20.583
if you do something transgressive on it,

2392
01:37:21.720 --> 01:37:24.210
you know, if you do something transgressive in real life,

2393
01:37:24.210 --> 01:37:26.250
maybe eight people who see it will say,

2394
01:37:26.250 --> 01:37:28.620
you shouldn't do that and will kind of modulate their voice

2395
01:37:28.620 --> 01:37:30.060
