2396
01:37:30.060 --> 01:37:31.680
based on your transgression.

2397
01:37:31.680 --> 01:37:35.010
If you do it online, it might be 2,000 people,

2398
01:37:35.010 --> 01:37:38.220
or might be 20,000 people who get really mad at you.

2399
01:37:38.220 --> 01:37:40.740
Probably not 20,000, but it'll be a really large number.

2400
01:37:40.740 --> 01:37:42.360
Or you're caught on video,

2401
01:37:42.360 --> 01:37:45.270
