01:37:45.270 --> 01:37:46.920
Right, yeah right.

2403
01:37:46.920 --> 01:37:51.090
Which it's sometimes it's a real transgression,

2404
01:37:51.090 --> 01:37:52.890
and sometimes it is not a real transgression

2405
01:37:52.890 --> 01:37:56.040
because these things move so quickly on social media.

2406
01:37:56.040 --> 01:37:58.260
And the incentives for each individual user

2407
01:37:58.260 --> 01:37:59.340
are to participate,

2408
01:37:59.340 --> 01:38:04.260
because participating in a pile-on on someone,

2409
01:38:04.260 --> 01:38:05.700
it feels really good.

2410
01:38:05.700 --> 01:38:08.130
It is physically pleasurable to do,

2411
01:38:08.130 --> 01:38:10.620
