2417
01:38:19.860 --> 01:38:20.850
against this transgressor.

2418
01:38:20.850 --> 01:38:23.940
And sometimes that can be productive.

2419
01:38:23.940 --> 01:38:26.430
I mean I talk about this Central Park incident

2420
