They've done these studies.

3352
02:15:58.380 --> 02:15:59.250
It is an appendage.

3353
02:15:59.250 --> 02:16:02.201
It might as well be embedded inside my brain.

3354
02:16:02.201 --> 02:16:04.320
You know what is a really fascinating thing to do?

3355
02:16:04.320 --> 02:16:05.220
Sit down with someone.

3356
02:16:05.220 --> 02:16:06.630
If they have their phone out,

3357
02:16:06.630 --> 02:16:10.470
and take their phone off the table and watch them,

3358
02:16:10.470 --> 02:16:12.690
it's like you took their arm off.

3359
02:16:12.690 --> 02:16:13.860
Just watch how they react

3360
02:16:13.860 --> 02:16:15.602
to seeing their phone taken away from them.

3361
02:16:15.602 --> 02:16:17.160
Because it does feel like an extension of ourselves,

3362
02:16:17.160 --> 02:16:20.280
which is not something that we acknowledge to ourselves

3363
02:16:20.280 --> 02:16:22.620
because it's not fun to admit that.

3364
02:16:22.620 --> 02:16:24.233
But if you become aware of it,

3365
02:16:24.233 --> 02:16:26.010
I think it makes it a little easier

3366
02:16:26.010 --> 02:16:26.850
to be kind of thoughtful.

3367
02:16:26.850 --> 02:16:29.040
Like okay, that phone is not actually me.

3368
02:16:29.040 --> 02:16:30.720
It's not actually my community.

3369
02:16:30.720 --> 02:16:31.830
It's not my social network.

3370
02:16:31.830 --> 02:16:34.290
It's not my friends and family.

3371
02:16:34.290 --> 02:16:36.180
It's just this little beeping device

3372
02:16:36.180 --> 02:16:38.250
that has some cool stuff on it occasionally.

3373
02:16:38.250 --> 02:16:41.580
And oh so rudimentary in the singularity

3374
02:16:41.580 --> 02:16:43.320
to which we're headed, right?

3375
02:16:43.320 --> 02:16:44.153
We'll look back,

3376
02:16:44.153 --> 02:16:46.490
can you believe they carried these things around?

3377
02:16:47.400 --> 02:16:49.440
And it's amazing, when you put it that way,

3378
02:16:49.440 --> 02:16:54.240
it's amazing how vast and rapid the changes have been

3379
02:16:54.240 --> 02:16:55.530
given that smartphones,

3380
02:16:55.530 --> 02:16:58.200
the kind of modern smartphones that we have now are so,

3381
02:16:58.200 --> 02:16:59.250
are they're so new.

3382
02:16:59.250 --> 02:17:00.510
So new.

3383
02:17:00.510 --> 02:17:01.620
That was crazy about going to Myanmar.

3384
02:17:01.620 --> 02:17:04.260
It's hard to remember pre-iPhone,

3385
02:17:04.260 --> 02:17:06.150
and yet it was kind of yesterday.

3386
02:17:06.150 --> 02:17:07.170
It was kind of yesterday.

3387
02:17:07.170 --> 02:17:09.630
And there, you can go to countries where,

3388
02:17:09.630 --> 02:17:13.230
